00:24:58.280 --> 00:24:59.980
If they'd been alerted 24 hours ago...

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:05.030
burrows might be alive we don't fully understand the nature of these manifestations they could

00:25:05.030 --> 00:25:11.220
pose other dangers i know there's a risk we're talking one more day that's all emory needs what

