00:26:20.980 --> 00:26:22.540
You liked me better when I worshipped your shadow.

00:26:24.550 --> 00:26:27.920
Yes, an honest answer.

00:26:30.030 --> 00:26:31.210
I think you'd be out of practice.

00:26:32.440 --> 00:26:36.600
You might want to reserve judgment on my actions until you've lost a son.

00:26:40.280 --> 00:26:44.650
I have lost someone close, and I do almost anything to get her back,

00:26:45.840 --> 00:26:47.300
except put other people in danger.

00:26:53.810 --> 00:26:55.730
And I used to argue all the time.

00:26:58.270 --> 00:26:59.970
Until I lost them, I realized...

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:04.360
is that those arguments were some of the happiest moments of my life.

00:27:08.740 --> 00:27:21.670
Junior, come in.

00:27:21.830 --> 00:27:26.930
Hey there.

00:27:27.500 --> 00:27:28.420
You must be poor at this.

00:27:29.430 --> 00:27:29.970
I heard a lot about you.

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:42.160
you he's got a lot of personality and an appetite to match i wanted to say that i'm sorry i should

00:27:42.160 --> 00:27:48.780
have come to you earlier i feel responsible you lost a crewman we can't change what's happened

00:27:50.280 --> 00:27:57.520
maybe some good can come out you think we can get him back i think that is possible that's

00:27:57.520 --> 00:27:58.500
enough reason for me to try

