I wonder what it must be like for him, you know.

00:28:10.760 --> 00:28:13.690
Is he in pain? Is he conscious?

00:28:17.430 --> 00:28:20.140
If he is, does he think that we've forgotten about him?

00:28:24.270 --> 00:28:28.860
Quinn was everything to my father, to both of us.

00:28:32.270 --> 00:28:34.990
Getting him back is all that we've thought about for the past 15 years.

00:28:35.880 --> 00:28:40.210
Let's hope when this is over, he'll have something else to think about.

00:28:46.850 --> 00:28:50.480
Power conversion tables. Some of these modifications should help.

00:28:51.040 --> 00:28:51.340
Thanks.

00:28:51.730 --> 00:28:52.510
Is there anything else?

00:28:53.750 --> 00:28:54.890
I think we're pretty much there.

00:28:58.270 --> 00:28:59.830
I'm trying to decide what to show for...

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:06.860
movie night movie night I thought I'd fire up the old tradition for a horror

