your free time cooped up in your room reading that bible of yours i may have found new priorities

00:29:35.760 --> 00:29:56.100
what's that supposed to mean i'm needed on the bridge captain archer archer picked up something

00:29:56.100 --> 00:29:58.940
it was in your area but i've lost it keep monitoring

00:30:01.880 --> 00:30:02.280
He's here.

00:30:02.440 --> 00:30:09.080
I'm in there.

00:30:53.520 --> 00:30:55.410
Repair is going to take a couple hours.

00:30:55.550 --> 00:30:56.270
Will it affect the transport?

00:31:00.000 --> 00:31:01.520
I can't believe you're still going through me.

00:31:01.520 --> 00:31:02.740
We're not going to have this argument again.

00:31:02.920 --> 00:31:05.040
That thing barely missed a stack of torpedoes.

00:31:05.450 --> 00:31:07.910
If it had jumped two feet to the left, we wouldn't be here to talk about it.

00:31:08.390 --> 00:31:10.810
We should concentrate on repairing the shit so we can get out of here.

00:31:10.890 --> 00:31:13.570
If we beam Quinn aboard, there won't be any more of these manifestations.

00:31:14.910 --> 00:31:15.730
How the hell do you know?

00:31:15.830 --> 00:31:16.010
Trip!

00:31:16.270 --> 00:31:18.330
You're putting your personal feelings before the safety of the shit.

00:31:18.370 --> 00:31:19.810
And you are this close to insubordination?

00:31:20.630 --> 00:31:20.950
Insubordination?

00:31:20.950 --> 00:31:21.710
