00:31:24.680 --> 00:31:25.500
Can you accept that?

00:31:28.130 --> 00:31:28.790
Do your job.

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:49.040
I got what I needed. You should be able to get a good lock when he reappears.

00:31:49.550 --> 00:31:58.700
What will that be? Just over three hours. How's your ship? We're ready. You saved my life.

00:32:00.030 --> 00:32:00.490
Forget it.

00:32:01.380 --> 00:32:02.980
You didn't deserve any of this, Jonathan.

00:32:04.980 --> 00:32:06.740
I'm sorry this became your problem.

00:32:07.500 --> 00:32:08.980
Let's make it worthwhile.

00:32:09.320 --> 00:32:11.250
Let's get Quinn back.

00:32:15.400 --> 00:32:15.740
Here.

00:32:17.200 --> 00:32:17.440
Blame you.

00:32:18.720 --> 00:32:20.220
I waited so long for this moment.

00:32:20.910 --> 00:32:21.770
