Recalibrate the confinement beam.

00:34:25.520 --> 00:34:27.380
That one helped get us a lock. Let's do it.

00:34:30.220 --> 00:34:32.730
I'm reading massive cellular deterioration.

00:34:32.890 --> 00:34:33.990
