00:34:52.260 --> 00:34:52.860
Wait for me.

00:34:54.190 --> 00:34:55.550
Tie in the secondary buffers.

00:34:57.340 --> 00:34:58.080
There's not enough time.

00:34:58.690 --> 00:34:58.930
Dad.

00:34:59.590 --> 00:34:59.970
I can hold...

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:06.930
the pattern just do it dad let him go no there's nothing you can do for him i can't let him go i

00:35:06.950 --> 00:35:16.170
can't save him

00:36:00.060 --> 00:36:00.280
What?

00:36:42.960 --> 00:36:51.940
Couldn't leave him like that.

00:36:54.490 --> 00:36:58.390
Better to be alive or dead, not somewhere in between.

00:37:01.790 --> 00:37:06.150
If it means anything, I guess his claim would feel the same way.

00:37:10.470 --> 00:37:12.110
I came here to bring my son home.

00:37:14.120 --> 00:37:16.040
I suppose I accomplished my goal.

00:37:19.960 --> 00:37:21.280
I've been in contact with Starfleet.

00:37:22.040 --> 00:37:23.960
I imagine they're not too happy with all this.

00:37:24.460 --> 00:37:26.600
I'm sure they'll take your achievements into consideration.

00:37:27.410 --> 00:37:29.970
I perpetrated a fraud to obtain the...

00:37:30.000 --> 00:37:37.310
use of your shoe. A member of your crew is dead. There's no way I'm going to avoid the consequences.

00:37:37.610 --> 00:37:48.820
A good thing will come out of this. Daniel won't have to worry about taking care of me anymore.

00:37:50.840 --> 00:37:55.850
I managed to let go of one of my children. I guess it's time for me to let go of the other.

00:37:57.220 --> 00:37:58.800
I always thought you should be out here.

00:38:00.570 --> 00:38:02.430
Maybe they'll put me somewhere where I'll be useful.

00:38:03.200 --> 00:38:04.360
Get a chance to teach.

00:38:05.770 --> 00:38:07.070
You'd probably be good at it.

00:38:08.780 --> 00:38:09.600
I wouldn't be boring.

00:38:10.940 --> 00:38:12.700
I settled for making myself miserable

00:38:12.700 --> 00:38:16.860
when I can spread the misery around to an entire class of students.

00:38:20.190 --> 00:38:23.490
Neurolytic enzymes are at the same level they were a week ago.

00:38:25.020 --> 00:38:26.380
No sign of Panar Syndrome.

00:38:28.970 --> 00:38:29.970
Still difficult for me.

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:35.580
me to accept. You were diagnosed with an incurable disease. Now it's gone. It's a big adjustment.

