00:39:45.130 --> 00:39:49.890
Learning, it seems, for the first time, what it truly means to be Vulcan.

00:39:52.000 --> 00:39:52.740
You can fill me in.

00:39:54.190 --> 00:39:55.330
Until I understand it myself.

00:40:00.924 --> 00:40:02.924
I don't think there'll be time for...

00:40:06.044 --> 00:40:07.044
What do you want me to say?

00:40:08.476 --> 00:40:09.476
that you understand.

00:40:11.420 --> 00:40:11.920
I do.

00:40:14.684 --> 00:40:16.684
It sounded like I didn't know this was coming.

00:40:26.428 --> 00:40:27.588
and a Warp Bank can still need me.

00:40:35.880 --> 00:40:42.160
Captain Starlog supplemental, we've rendezvoused with the Sarajevo, which will be returning Emery and Danica to Earth.

00:40:44.220 --> 00:40:44.740
Safe journey.

00:40:46.880 --> 00:40:47.740
And you, Jonathan.

00:40:52.000 --> 00:40:58.800
Honor working with you.

00:41:01.244 --> 00:41:02.044
Some suggestions.

00:41:04.476 --> 00:41:07.516
might boost your transporter range a few hundred kilometers.

00:41:09.692 --> 00:41:10.352
Couldn't resist.

00:41:12.892 --> 00:41:13.392
Check it out.

00:41:16.668 --> 00:41:18.068
Say goodbye to Porthos.

00:41:19.964 --> 00:41:20.964
Good luck.

00:41:21.372 --> 00:41:23.372
Maybe I'll see you around.
